+        """Return a real file descriptor backing this stream.
+
+        ``BytesIO`` has no file descriptor, so passing a captured stream to
+        something that needs one, such as ``subprocess.run(stdout=sys.stdout)``,
+        raises ``io.UnsupportedOperation``. A temporary file is created on
+        demand instead, and anything written to its descriptor is copied into
